Security Policy
===============
If there are any vulnerabilities in the software
that Dumpware installs onto your personal computer,
please report it immediatly for yours and the
other safety.

Vulnerability Reporting
=======================
Please fill out the template when reporting any
vulnerability in the software (git@jbreda.dev).

************************************************************************
*                                                                      *
*  Vulnerability-Report Template                                       *
*  =============================                                       *
*                                                                      *
*  Software: software name (e.g. Dumpware)                             *
*  Version: contaminated version (e.g. 3.01.04)                        *
*  Type: type of vulnerability (e.g. Trojan)                           *
*  Weight: severity of vulnerability (e.g. immidiate)                  *
*                                                                      *
************************************************************************
